factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 6 problems
  Draft says 'காரமடை அருகே' (near Karamadai) in the headline, reel and caption, but the article says the elderly victim is from Karamadai area (காரமடை பகுதி); the location of the fraud is only given as 'கோவை அருகே'. The place is stated differently from the article.
  Reel script and slides say the victim was 'காரமடையைச் சேர்ந்த' (from Karamadai), which matches the article, but the reel headline/slide framing 'காரமடை: முதியவரிடம்' presents Karamadai as the fraud location, which is not stated in the article.
  The article says the accused was arrested by Coimbatore district cyber crime police and that he is currently in a Chennai prison after a different case; the reel says he was arrested but the phrase 'தற்போது சென்னை சிறையில் உள்ளார்' after 'கைது' is presented as if he is in prison now, while the article says he was jailed for another case, so the reason for the custody is omitted.
  The article says the victim was 64 years old and that Vishal Kishor is 35; the reel says 'விஷால் கிஷோர் (35 வயது)' which matches, but the caption says 'இவர் மீது ஏற்கெனவே 11 மோசடி வழக்குகள் நிலுவையில் உள்ளன' without noting these were pending cases, which is accurate; no issue there.
  The reel script omits that the accused was arrested in the case and that the arrest happened after investigation of bank transaction records, a key step of the arrest; the phrase 'பணம் சென்ற வங்கிக் கணக்குகளை ஆய்வு செய்தனர்' is present, so this is fine, but the article's key result that the accused was identified via bank accounts is only partially conveyed.
  Caption states 'வழக்குப் பதிவு செய்து விசாரித்தனர்' and the reel states the same; however the caption and reel say the victim was 'முதியவரிடம்' and the caption claims 'மோசடி வழக்குகள் பதிவாகியுள்ளன' in Coimbatore, Chennai, Madurai, which omits Chengalpattu, Tambaram, Virudhunagar, Karur named in the article but this is an incomplete list rather than an error.
