  The reel_script and slides_spec say the 35-year-old Vishal Kishor was arrested, but the article gives his age as 35 only in the name parenthesis; this is consistent, so no issue there. However the caption says he 'is in Chennai prison' while the article says he was lodged in Chennai prison after a different case; the caption mixes the two facts into one sentence, which is acceptable only if clearly separated.
  The reel_script omits the important fact that the accused was already in Chennai prison (arrested in another case) at the time of this case's arrest, which is a key result of the investigation.
